WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Another job application? Fill the details you already saved.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.000
One click fills your name, email, and phone, then matches your resume.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.600
Review every change. Undo if needed. You decide when to submit.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.200
Works with dropdowns, checkboxes, and fields that appear later.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.000
Start with 3 profiles free. Lifetime Pro is $39.99; monthly and yearly plans are also available.
